@startuml dev-case-lifecycle
title Dev extension — case-scenario lifecycle (need -> artifacts -> distribute -> evaluate)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8F2
  BorderColor #C9603F
}

start
:Customer intake\n(stack, responsibilities, codebase URLs);
note right: DevNeed

:Pull RepoSnapshot\n(reuse GitHub fetch: langs, dirs,\nframeworks, recent commits, LOC);

:**analyze_need** (LLM + fallback)\nreflect the need against the REAL codebase\n-> real stack, stated-vs-real gaps, true complexity;
note right: NeedAnalysis · task: need_analysis

fork
  :**design_role** (LLM)\n-> RoleSpec (maps to Job);
fork again
  :**design_case** (LLM)\nassignment grounded in the real codebase\n+ COVERT tooling-probes;
  note right: CaseScenario · coverProbes[]
end fork

:**Human gate** — recruiter reviews / edits /\napproves role + assignment;
note right: Decisions approval

if (approved?) then (yes)
  :Distribution adapter (pluggable)\nOUT: publish role / send case;
  note right: 3rd-party seam (local stub first)
  :Distribution adapter\nIN: receive candidates + submissions;
  note right: Submission (repoRef)

  :**evaluate_submission** (LLM)\ncase -> code-structure analysis;
  fork
    :**reflect_commits**\n"where they mentally went";
  fork again
    :**assess_tooling**\nprobe outcomes, fluency\n(using tools never penalised);
  end fork
  :**score_transfer**\ndoes it transfer to THIS role?;
  note right: CaseEvaluation + TransferAssessment

  :Candidate -> pipeline entry\n+ Decisions review card\n(compare / rank);
else (no)
  :revise artifacts;
  stop
endif

stop
@enduml
